<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" data-framework="jquery"><head>
        <meta charset="UTF-8">
        <meta name="description" content="A TodoMVC written in jQuery.">
        <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
        <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="ie=edge">
        <title>TodoMVC: jQuery</title>
        <link rel="stylesheet" href="base.css">
        <link rel="stylesheet" href="index.css">
        <link rel="stylesheet" href="app.css">
    </head>
    <body class="learn-bar"><aside class="learn"><header> <h3>jQuery</h3> <span class="source-links">   <h5>Example</h5> <a href="https://github.com/tastejs/todomvc/tree/gh-pages/examples/jquery">Source</a>   </span> </header> <hr> <blockquote class="quote speech-bubble"> <p>jQuery is a fast, small, and feature-rich JavaScript library. It makes things like HTML document traversal and manipulation, event handling, animation, and Ajax much simpler with an easy-to-use API that works across a multitude of browsers. With a combination of versatility and extensibility, jQuery has changed the way that millions of people write JavaScript.</p> <footer> <a href="http://jquery.com">jQuery</a> </footer> </blockquote>  <hr>  <h4>Official Resources</h4> <ul>  <li> <a href="http://learn.jquery.com/about-jquery/how-jquery-works">How jQuery Works</a> </li>  <li> <a href="http://api.jquery.com">API Reference</a> </li>  <li> <a href="http://plugins.jquery.com">Plugins</a> </li>  <li> <a href="http://jquery.com/browser-support">Brower Support</a> </li>  <li> <a href="http://blog.jquery.com">Blog</a> </li>  </ul>  <h4>Articles and Guides</h4> <ul>  <li> <a href="http://try.jquery.com">Try jQuery</a> </li>  <li> <a href="http://robflaherty.github.io/jquery-annotated-source/">jQuery Annotated Source</a> </li>  <li> <a href="http://paulirish.com/2010/10-things-i-learned-from-the-jquery-source">10 Things I Learned From the jQuery Source</a> </li>  </ul>  <h4>Community</h4> <ul>  <li> <a href="http://stackoverflow.com/questions/tagged/jquery">jQuery on Stack Overflow</a> </li>  <li> <a href="http://forum.jquery.com">Forums</a> </li>  <li> <a href="http://twitter.com/jquery">jQuery on Twitter</a> </li>  </ul>   <footer> <hr> <em>If you have other helpful links to share, or find any of the links above no longer work, please <a href="https://github.com/tastejs/todomvc/issues">let us know</a>.</em> </footer></aside>
        <section id="todoapp" class="todoapp">
            <header id="header" class="header">
                <h1>todos</h1>
                <input id="new-todo" class="new-todo" placeholder="What needs to be done?" autofocus="">
            </header>
            <main id="main" class="main" style="display: none;">
                <div class="toggle-all-container">
                    <input id="toggle-all" class="toggle-all" type="checkbox">
                    <label for="toggle-all">Mark all as complete</label>
                </div>
                <ul id="todo-list" class="todo-list">
        </ul>
            </main>
            <footer id="footer" class="footer" style="display: none;">
            <span id="todo-count" class="todo-count"><strong>0</strong> items left</span>
            <ul id="filters" class="filters">
                <li>
                    <a class="selected" href="#/all">All</a>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <a href="#/active">Active</a>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <a href="#/completed">Completed</a>
                </li>
            </ul>
            
        </footer>
        </section>
        <footer id="info" class="info">
            <p>Double-click to edit a todo</p>
            <p>Created by <a href="http://sindresorhus.com">Sindre Sorhus</a></p>
            <p>Updated by the TodoMVC Team</p>
            <p>Part of <a href="http://todomvc.com">TodoMVC</a></p>
        </footer>
        <script async="" src="https://www.google-analytics.com/analytics.js"></script><script id="todo-template" type="text/x-handlebars-template">
            {{#this as |item index|}}
            <li class="{{#if item.completed}} completed{{/if}}" data-id="{{item.id}}"">
                <div class="view">
                    <input class="toggle" type="checkbox" {{#if item.completed}}checked{{/if}}>
                    <label>{{item.title}}</label>
                    <button class="destroy"></button>
                </div>
                <input class="edit" value="{{item.title}}">
            </li>
        {{/this}}
        </script>
        <script id="footer-template" type="text/x-handlebars-template">
            <span id="todo-count" class="todo-count"><strong>{{activeTodoCount}}</strong> {{activeTodoWord}} left</span>
            <ul id="filters" class="filters">
                <li>
                    <a {{#eq filter 'all'}}class="selected"{{/eq}} href="#/all">All</a>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <a {{#eq filter 'active'}}class="selected"{{/eq}}href="#/active">Active</a>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <a {{#eq filter 'completed'}}class="selected"{{/eq}}href="#/completed">Completed</a>
                </li>
            </ul>
            {{#if completedTodos}}<button class="clear-completed">Clear completed</button>{{/if}}
        </script>
        <!-- <script src="base.js"></script> -->
		<script src="base.js"></script>
        <script src="jquery.min.js"></script>
        <script src="handlebars.min.js"></script>
        <script src="director.min.js"></script>
        <script src="app.js"></script>
    

<div id="appIsReady"></div></body></html>
